OL,3,GNEWSAClosing urgent care centres would
OL,4,Ahave 'dire consequences', objectors say
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to close urgent primary care
OL,7,Fservices at three hospitals would have
OL,8,F"dire consequences", objectors say.
OL,10,FBetsi Cadawaladr health board has
OL,11,Fconfirmed it is consulting on a
OL,12,Fproposal to end urgent primary care
OL,13,Fcentre (UPCC) services at Ysbyty
OL,14,FPenrhos Stanley in Holyhead, Ysbyty
OL,15,FAlltwen in Tremadog and Ysbyty Gwynedd
OL,16,Fin Bangor.
OL,18,FIt said access to urgent care was a
OL,19,F"priority" but the centres had faced
OL,20,Ffinancial pressures and ongoing
OL,21,Frecruitment difficulties.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,439,430,260,140,0,100
