OL,3,GNEWSAClosing urgent care centres would
OL,4,Ahave 'dire consequences', objectors say
OL,5,
OL,6,FIf approved, they would be shut by 31
OL,7,FMarch 2027, but the move has sparked
OL,8,Fopposition, including claims it would
OL,9,Fcause additional pressure on GP
OL,10,Fpractices and emergency departments -
OL,11,Fthe services they were established to
OL,12,Fease pressure on.
